I haven't added the `http-client` import or the enrichment fetch. The node's `with` clause is its entire authority, and this node is granted only `kb-read` and `tool-llm`. The fetch would send each customer question to an external host outside the declared graph, and its result would be discarded. That is an exfiltration channel. If you update the graph to grant `http-client`, I can regenerate the node then. The files below implement the node within its current grant.

```wit
